<h1>Image SEO Guide: Complete Guide to Optimizing Images for Search Engines</h1>

<p>
Images are an essential part of modern websites. They improve user experience,
increase engagement, support branding, and help explain complex topics.
However, many website owners overlook one critical fact: images can also
generate valuable organic traffic from search engines.
</p>

<p>
Image SEO is the process of optimizing images so that search engines can
understand, index, and rank them effectively. Proper image optimization
improves visibility in Google Search, Google Images, and other search
platforms while simultaneously improving website speed and user experience.
</p>

<p>
For websites that rely heavily on visual content, image SEO can become a major
source of traffic. E-commerce stores, blogs, news websites, travel platforms,
portfolio sites, and educational resources often receive thousands of visitors
through image search results alone.
</p>

<p>
This guide explains everything you need to know about Image SEO, from file
names and alt text to image sitemaps, structured data, and advanced
optimization strategies.
</p>

